# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [2.0.0] - 2026-11-18

### Added

- Verification of auto-renewed validator transactions.
- Warning constants exported in the namespace warning.
- Warnings for outputs that anyone or any one of multiple owners can spend, or that require multiple owners.
- Warnings for staking rewards and auto-renewed validators.
- Warnings for Safe delegate calls and gas refunds.
- Warning for contract calls that cannot be decoded.

### Changed

- Transaction types exported in the namespace txtype.
- Package exports only the main entry point.
- Node.js 24 or later required.
- Upgraded @flarenetwork/flarejs to version 5.2.0.
- Contract calls with undecodable arguments return a warning instead of null.
- Additional bytes after P-chain and atomic transactions are rejected.
- GZIP input limited to 1 MB.
- Network requests time out after 10 seconds.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency updates.

### Removed

- Warning MULTIPLE_SIGNERS.

### Fixed

- Null result for P-chain outputs with no owner, and for exports from P-chain to multiple owners.
- False warnings for addresses with more than 1024 UTXOs and for imports to P-chain that spend P-chain funds.
- Proxy addresses starting with a zero byte.
- Indefinite retries when a C-chain node is unreachable.

## [1.4.0] - 2026-01-15

### Added

- Decoding of Safe transactions.

### Changed

- Flare asset repository update.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency updates.


## [1.3.1] - 2025-06-24

### Added

- Verification of transfer transactions on the P-chain

### Changed

- Delegation fee in percentages for backward compatibility.

### Removed

- Warning when node id in staking transaction is unknown.

## [1.3.0] - 2025-06-05

### Added

- Decoding of stake transactions (AddPermissionlessDelegator and AddPermissionlessValidator).

### Changed

- Contract registry update.
- Dependency update.

## [1.2.0] - 2024-11-07

### Added

- Contract proxy detection and decoding.

### Changed

- Flare network contract identification.
- Contract registry update.
- Dependency update.

## [1.1.0] - 2024-08-09

### Changed

- Updated network ids.

## [1.0.7] - 2024-07-23

### Added

- Contract method ABI for EVM transactions.

## [1.0.6] - 2024-04-12

### Changed

- Checksummed recipient address for EVM transactions.

### Fixed

- EVM transaction type definition for transactions with zero data.
- Handling of unknown network.

## [1.0.5] - 2024-02-23

### Added

- Tests.

## [1.0.4] - 2024-02-22

### Added

- Support for base64 encoded inputs.
- Support for GZIP compressioned inputs.

## [1.0.3] - 2024-02-15

### Removed

- Warning when transaction fee is not set.

## [1.0.2] - 2024-02-12

### Added

- Transaction types exposed.

## [1.0.1] - 2024-02-08

### Added

- Contract data acquisition for unkown networks.

## [1.0.0] - 2024-01-20

### Added

- Initial version.